  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 949888705a618cc40ae0e9257d66d411, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractionScript
  noteText: "I want to start by saying that I\u2019m incredibly grateful to you all
    for being here. Brigette was nothing if not humble. She wouldn\u2019t believe
    you when you told her just how many lives she\u2019d touched. You are all proof
    of how loved she is. It was only [VAR] days ago that we lost her. We\u2019re
    still learning to change our routine.  The kids and I never had any sort of plan
    for this. I bet you can tell by how scattered I am that she was the \r\n\r\n"
  noteNum: 6
